WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.036
We hope you're all doing great
tonight.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:05.605
Now let's get to the news.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.206
President Biden met yesterday

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:10.442
with executives from Apple,
Google, and JPMorgan Chase

00:00:10.442 --> 00:00:12.312
to discuss cybersecurity,

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:16.282
where they suggested not writing
the nuclear codes on his hand.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.484
Senator Bernie Sanders
is set to visit

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.353
Iowa and Indiana this weekend

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:24.924
to promote Democrats' new
$3.5 trillion spending proposal,

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.459
though it might have been better

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.661
if he'd waited until
after the harvest.

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:31.864
"Somebody help me find my way
out of here!"

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:34.633
The CEO of Delta Air Lines
said in a new interview

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:38.237
that he won't refer to the new
coronavirus variant as "Delta,"

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:40.973
though I don't think it's cool
that he keeps calling it

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.543
the Air China virus.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.979
The Los Angeles County
District Attorney's Office

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.414
announced yesterday
that porn star Ron Jeremy

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.849
has been indicted

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.051
on more than 30 counts
of sexual assault.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:56.222
Man, it's always the guy
you most suspect.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.558
A zoo in Belgium
recently banned a woman

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.394
because she's having
a self-described affair

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:02.662
with a chimpanzee

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:05.164
which is negatively affecting
his relationship

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.165
with other apes.

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.900
And just a guess here --

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.336
hers with other humans?

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:13.906
A luxury clothing brand
that made a cashmere sweater

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.341
that read "Cuomosexual"

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.777
has offered to restitch sweaters
for customers,

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:21.280
though I'm not sure they came up
with the most elegant solution.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.816
The makers of Mountain Dew
have announced

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.651
they will release
a limited-edition

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.920
Flamin' Hot Cheeto-flavored
soda,

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.056
and the FDA
is already scrambling

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.558
to approve a vaccine for it.

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.460
That's right, the makers
of Mountain Dew will release

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.063
the limited-edition Flamin' Hot
Cheeto-flavored soda,

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:40.033
and fans are giving it
two Tums up.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.034
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.103
It works, Shoemaker.

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:46.539
A small plane recently
made an emergency landing

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.907
on a California highway.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.642
Drivers were shocked when
a plane landed in front of them

00:01:50.642 --> 00:01:53.446
and Harrison Ford
didn't get out.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.281
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.216
2020 was Europe's hottest year
on record.

00:01:57.216 --> 00:02:01.521
It was so hot, one guy in France
almost took off his scarf.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.722
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

